{
  "name": "PDF Product Creation Pipeline",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "pdf-product-start",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "webhook-trigger",
      "name": "Webhook Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [250, 300],
      "webhookId": "pdf-product-creation"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "functionCode": "// Step 1: Research emotional problems using search data\n// Read from webhook body (standard n8n webhook format)\nconst body = $json.body || $json;\nconst niche = body.niche || 'parenting';\nconst keywords = body.keywords || [];\n\n// Output structure for trend research\n// Return array format as expected by n8n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    niche: niche,\n    keywords: keywords,\n    timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),\n    step: 'trend_research',\n    ready_for_ai: true\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "step1-research",
      "name": "Step 1: Identify Problem",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [450, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "claudeApi",
        "resource": "message",
        "model": "claude-sonnet-4",
        "text": "=You are a product title expert. Based on the niche \"{{ $json.niche }}\" and search trends, create a catchy, emotional title and subtitle for a PDF guide.\n\nThe title should:\n- Be emotionally compelling\n- Address a specific pain point\n- Be under 10 words\n- Create urgency or relate to a common struggle\n\nFormat your response as JSON:\n{\n  \"title\": \"Your catchy title here\",\n  \"subtitle\": \"Your compelling subtitle that explains the solution\",\n  \"target_audience\": \"Who this is for\"\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "step2-title-generation",
      "name": "Step 2: Generate Title with Claude",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatAnthropic",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [650, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "functionCode": "// Parse JSON response from Claude\n// Claude may wrap JSON in markdown code blocks\nlet response = $input.item.json.response || $input.item.json.text || $input.item.json.content;\n\n// Clean up markdown code fences if present\nif (typeof response === 'string') {\n  response = response.replace(/```json\\n?/g, '');\n  response = response.replace(/```\\n?/g, '');\n  response = response.trim();\n  \n  try {\n    const parsed = JSON.parse(response);\n    return [{\n      json: parsed\n    }];\n  } catch (e) {\n    throw new Error(`Failed to parse Claude response as JSON: ${e.message}. Response was: ${response.substring(0, 200)}`);\n  }\n} else {\n  // Already an object\n  return [{\n    json: response\n  }];\n}"
      },
      "id": "step2-parse-json",
      "name": "Step 2b: Parse Title JSON",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [750, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "claudeApi",
        "resource": "message",
        "model": "claude-sonnet-4",
        "text": "=Create a comprehensive PDF guide with the following details:\n\nTitle: {{ $json.title }}\nSubtitle: {{ $json.subtitle }}\nTarget Audience: {{ $json.target_audience }}\n\nWrite a complete, actionable guide with:\n\n1. Introduction (addressing the pain point)\n2. Understanding the Problem (why this matters)\n3. The Solution Framework (3-5 main strategies)\n4. Step-by-step implementation for each strategy\n5. Common mistakes to avoid\n6. Quick wins (immediate actions readers can take)\n7. Long-term success tips\n8. Conclusion with encouragement\n\nMake it:\n- Practical and actionable\n- Empathetic and understanding\n- 15-20 pages worth of content\n- Written in a conversational, supportive tone\n- Include specific examples\n\nFormat as markdown with clear headings.",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "step3-content-generation",
      "name": "Step 3: Generate PDF Content",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatAnthropic",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [950, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "functionCode": "// Step 4: Prepare Canva design request\nconst titleData = $('Step 2b: Parse Title JSON').item.json;\nconst content = $input.item.json;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    design_request: {\n      title: titleData.title,\n      subtitle: titleData.subtitle,\n      content_markdown: content.response || content.content || content.text,\n      design_type: 'pdf_guide',\n      pages_needed: 20,\n      style: 'professional_warm',\n      color_scheme: 'emotional_trustworthy',\n      cover_image_source: 'unsplash',\n      author_persona: 'experienced_parent'\n    },\n    canva_template: 'guide-template-emotional',\n    next_step: 'shopify_setup'\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "step4-design-prep",
      "name": "Step 4: Prepare Design Request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1150, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://api.canva.com/v1/designs",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "canvaApi",
        "method": "POST",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{ $credentials.canvaApi.apiKey }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"design_type\": \"{{ $json.design_request.design_type }}\",\n  \"title\": \"{{ $json.design_request.title }}\"\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "step4-canva-api",
      "name": "Step 4: Create Canva Design",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.1,
      "position": [1350, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://{{ $credentials.shopifyApi.shopDomain }}/admin/api/2024-01/products.json",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "shopifyApi",
        "method": "POST",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-Shopify-Access-Token",
              "value": "={{ $credentials.shopifyApi.accessToken }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"product\": {\n    \"title\": \"{{ $('Step 2b: Parse Title JSON').item.json.title }}\",\n    \"body_html\": \"<p>{{ $('Step 2b: Parse Title JSON').item.json.subtitle }}</p>\",\n    \"vendor\": \"Freedom Angel Corp\",\n    \"product_type\": \"Digital Download\",\n    \"tags\": \"pdf,guide,{{ $('Step 1: Identify Problem').item.json.niche }}\",\n    \"variants\": [\n      {\n        \"price\": \"29.00\",\n        \"sku\": \"PDF-{{ $now.toMillis() }}\",\n        \"inventory_management\": null\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "step5-shopify-product",
      "name": "Step 5: Create Shopify Product",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.1,
      "position": [1550, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "functionCode": "// Step 6: Prepare YouTube influencer outreach campaign\nconst product = $input.item.json;\nconst titleData = $('Step 2b: Parse Title JSON').item.json;\nconst niche = $('Step 1: Identify Problem').item.json.niche;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    outreach_campaign: {\n      niche: niche,\n      product_title: titleData.title,\n      product_url: product.product?.admin_graphql_api_id || 'pending',\n      target_platforms: ['youtube'],\n      offer_structure: {\n        option_a: {\n          type: 'high_commission',\n          rate: '50%',\n          description: 'Earn 50% commission on every sale'\n        },\n        option_b: {\n          type: 'flat_fee_plus_commission',\n          flat_fee: '$700',\n          commission: '15%',\n          description: '$700 upfront + 15% ongoing commission'\n        }\n      },\n      video_requirements: {\n        duration: '30-60 seconds',\n        integration_type: 'sponsored_segment',\n        talking_points: [\n          'Authentic problem-solution story',\n          'Personal connection to the struggle',\n          'Clear call-to-action with discount code'\n        ]\n      },\n      influencer_criteria: {\n        min_subscribers: 10000,\n        niche_match: niche,\n        engagement_rate: '>3%',\n        audience_demographics: 'parents, caregivers'\n      }\n    },\n    status: 'ready_for_outreach',\n    next_step: 'send_outreach_emails'\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "step6-influencer-prep",
      "name": "Step 6: Prepare Influencer Campaign",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1750, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ $json }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "response-node",
      "name": "Return Success Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1950, 300]
    }
  ],
